* ideal_ccs.lib — ideal CCS + drive switches for L1 oracle (GATE-L1-CYCLE)
* Abstraction: behavioral only — not silicon (TL431/OPA192/DMOS).
* Sim assumption (not a frozen ICD value): Ic=600 mA, Ic/2=300 mA
*
* ideal_ccs: gated half-select sink/source between plus and minus.
*   V(en)>0.5 → |I|=ihalf; V(pol)≈+1 WRITE (plus→minus), V(pol)≈-1 READ (reverse).
* ideal_drive_switch: connects a selected line end to the drive rail (oracle: AGND).

.subckt ideal_ccs plus minus en pol
.param ihalf=0.3
Gcs plus minus value={ihalf * u(V(en)-0.5) * V(pol)}
.ends ideal_ccs

.subckt ideal_drive_switch a b ctrl
Ssw a b ctrl 0 sw1
.model sw1 sw(vt=0.5 vh=0.1 ron=0.05 roff=100G)
.ends ideal_drive_switch

.subckt ideal_ccs_dc plus minus
.param ihalf=0.3
Gccs plus minus DC {ihalf}
.ends ideal_ccs_dc
